  "summary": "Three prophecies place the qippod in the ruins of a city or land. Several related languages name a hedgehog with this word. Hezekiah uses a similarly spelled verb when he compares his life to a weaver’s work, and Ezekiel uses a noun for the terror that comes when peace fails.",
